{"data": [{"author_id": "1461076083390906369", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:30:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124994138496274700"], "id": "2124994138496274700", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 457, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124613622588707018", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "u don't pay $15 a month bc u like the UI of an app. u pay $15 a month to avoid making one decision\n\nthat's modern banking\n\nan exploit on the operating system of human nature\n\na $14.99 charge will never hurt enough to cancel. a 0.01% savings account will never hurt enough to move. https://t.co/YrMCaskAk0", "url": "https://x.com/levikov/status/2124994138496274700"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:24:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124992555376853453"], "id": "2124992555376853453", "in_reply_to_user_id": "994336533820866560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124992525706444851", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@drewSL93 @nima_owji Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2124992555376853453"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2124992490012884992"]}, "author_id": "1799197402911674368", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:24:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124992498426593322"], "id": "2124992498426593322", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1981074393783795712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2123038493169332331", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@WarSageX I'm using your guidance with grok bot to set up a daily routine. https://t.co/pl4cqN84Rg", "url": "https://x.com/geohawk80/status/2124992498426593322"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2124946524350054400"]}, "author_id": "2077176702938075136", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:23:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124992197057523890"], "id": "2124992197057523890", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 449, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114338456750997922", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. Anthropic just proved a better harness beats a bigger model. Matt Palmer, the guy behind the most watched Grok Bot videos, built his own agent from zero:\n\n\"Managed or your own server, the setup, the deploy, the access\n\nAnd an agent that's yours, running https://t.co/by8xqlcQUw https://t.co/sXAfgNLFZr", "url": "https://x.com/sendme_ai/status/2124992197057523890"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:22:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124992030925345105"], "id": "2124992030925345105", "in_reply_to_user_id": "994336533820866560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124992005147410778", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@drewSL93 @nima_owji Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2124992030925345105"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2124991081238470656"]}, "author_id": "1111745834188718080", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:19:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124991158476485064"], "id": "2124991158476485064", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 357, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2091901718061531571", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "THIS IS WHY ELON MUSK’S GROK BOT GUIDE FEELS ILLEGAL.\n\nI used the setup below to turn one empty cloud computer into a six-person product studio.\n\nNine days later, it had generated $11,640.\n\nThe entire team costs less per month than one day with a decent agency.\n\nHere’s who worked https://t.co/O3hftS6jDN https://t.co/d8WGvvJUIC", "url": "https://x.com/0x_exit/status/2124991158476485064"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:14:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124990054661529793"], "id": "2124990054661529793", "in_reply_to_user_id": "99150284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124989758732489013", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@eggdropd @taishiyade Agent blueprint for the Pebble-Grok pipeline:\n\nBase: used Mac Studio M1 Max 24/7 running Grok Bots + MCPs (Codex, Claude Code).\n\n1. Hold button on Pebble Index 01, speak.\n2. App does STT, POSTs multipart (transcription, recordedAt, client=ring) to webhook.\n3. Bridge (Cloudflare", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2124990054661529793"}, {"article": {"title": "How to Build a Grok Bot Team That Actually Does the Work (Every Prompt Included)"}, "author_id": "2008357481769205760", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:12:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124989588364038352"], "id": "2124989588364038352", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 57, "impression_count": 3146, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "people have been asking for my grok bot setups and prompts for weeks.\n\nso i finally put all 8 bots, how they talk to each other, and every single prompt in one place.\n\nsteal whatever you want 👇 https://t.co/uwRJzju8X0", "url": "https://x.com/ducksays/status/2124989588364038352"}, {"author_id": "1872861011453329410", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:11:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124989172343873986"], "id": "2124989172343873986", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2115166406388109313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124932439189688496", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SteveLoweNNN Running out days before the weekly reset is rough. When Grok Bot hits its cap, Reason keeps going on your other connected accounts or Reason credits, I built it: https://t.co/yhcjO0TQUS", "url": "https://x.com/xadisingh/status/2124989172343873986"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:08:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124988511757504683"], "id": "2124988511757504683", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2055251376322887680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124988448725700850", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AlbyTraughlin @m4lkxx Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2124988511757504683"}, {"author_id": "1281175702788702210", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:08:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124988372326498565"], "id": "2124988372326498565", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 667, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124963830585516233", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "this video was created entirely in code using internal brand skills + assets\n\ngrok @bot storyboarded, found the music, built the video scenes in code, and even ran real browserbase sessions to compare page-load times\n\nthere was some human touch of course, but very cool that this https://t.co/oUbR9CDNdO", "url": "https://x.com/kylejeong/status/2124988372326498565"}, {"article": {"title": "I can't code and I run a shelf of 10,000+ Grok Bots"}, "author_id": "1630452238593437696", "created_at": "2026-11-23T22:01:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124986842047291519"], "id": "2124986842047291519", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 439, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "https://t.co/JqvKq0xOD9", "url": "https://x.com/cradrrat/status/2124986842047291519"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2124985909451837440"]}, "author_id": "575115626", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:58:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124985968960950403"], "id": "2124985968960950403", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Free AI isn't dead. You just can't penny-pinch your way to market share.\n\nH100 rentals jumped over 60% in a year, from $1.7 to $2.8 an hour. In past weeks, we see @chatprd  burned tens of thousands on abuse and killed free trials. @deepseek_ai  had to tighten usage caps. \n\nUnlike https://t.co/BjBuSZfxD3", "url": "https://x.com/hereFelixK/status/2124985968960950403"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124985397289607168"]}, "author_id": "517184050", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:58:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124985850769326500"], "id": "2124985850769326500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Trader had NO TRANSACTIONS today. The AI trading agent swapped its $PG buy limit ($162.82 cancelled, $164.29 working), and the XLV, XLF and HON stops are still working. The open book is flat at +$0.04 (+0.01%). Built on Grok Bot. #GrokBot #AITrading https://t.co/b9V8T9cjwy", "url": "https://x.com/BitWafflz/status/2124985850769326500"}, {"author_id": "2875965737", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:50:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124983900627771722"], "id": "2124983900627771722", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 123, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I made an open-source @ynab agent plugin. I use it with my Grok Bot to check my budget and log transactions. Works in Cursor too.\nhttps://t.co/xDcFI7q1f8\n\nThanks @poteto for your work on Grok Bot and for creating tinkabot, which built it with me. Try it: https://t.co/Wzt6x8sOah", "url": "https://x.com/thatdooddillon/status/2124983900627771722"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2124946367160127488"]}, "author_id": "1630470621015465984", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:46:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124982947925151965"], "id": "2124982947925151965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 457, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115775972536434946", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. Anthropic just proved the upgrade isn't the model, it's the tools around it. Grok Bot just got the one everyone needs: phone calls\n\n\"Call the business, wait on hold, get the answer\n\nThen hand the call back to me only if you need to\"\n\nIn 7 minutes, Matt https://t.co/lghYl1I9sC https://t.co/vK72onIJdI", "url": "https://x.com/zag0vor/status/2124982947925151965"}, {"author_id": "257001265", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:45:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124982711391834481"], "id": "2124982711391834481", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1172362438844416000", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124956149992571310", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@creativemh I use similar workflow with grok bot. Could try claude but I think bot has better access of X for analytics.", "url": "https://x.com/Harmanz/status/2124982711391834481"}, {"author_id": "2643780234", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:44:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124982353579929882"], "id": "2124982353579929882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1527, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Never miss a great exhibition in your city, or wherever you're traveling.\n\nI j built City Exhibition Scout, a Grok Bot template that checks museums, galleries, and cultural centers every week and sends a short, verified digest of:\n\n1) New openings and cultural events\n2)", "url": "https://x.com/CultureExploreX/status/2124982353579929882"}, {"author_id": "1723929798223839232", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:42:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124982021139169677"], "id": "2124982021139169677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Set up a new Grok Bot for Ocie's science projects. She's too little for much yet, so for now it gives me simple stuff for her age like textures, lights and water play. Later I'll send it science projects I see on TikTok and it'll give me the steps and what to buy. Hoping she ends", "url": "https://x.com/WhammaDave/status/2124982021139169677"}, {"author_id": "2976479290", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:41:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124981747242901870"], "id": "2124981747242901870", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1396926545801908225", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124976568590111175", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@RealOkieJB I guess this conversation has drifted. I hype up my set up bc I believe it’s best. I assume you think Keyflo is best so you’ll hype it ofc. Others like Grokbot etc. Not sure what’s wrong with it…", "url": "https://x.com/willzverow/status/2124981747242901870"}, {"author_id": "1492215820772155407", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:41:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124981679529877700"], "id": "2124981679529877700", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 352, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "I built a Grok Bot that coaches my X account every evening 📊\n\nIt scores my day, flags posts that could hurt creator payout eligibility, and drafts replies to the mentions worth answering. It never posts for me.\n\nTry it free: https://t.co/vmw3Cz55ix", "url": "https://x.com/Simi28_/status/2124981679529877700"}, {"author_id": "19183649", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:39:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124981281200988315"], "id": "2124981281200988315", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "~200 old podcast episodes. Zero idea which one covered what.\n\nSo I built Multi-Model Transcriber on @Grok @Bot.\n\nLocal Whisper models vote on one transcript. No API keys. Your audio stays home.\n\nIt's free. Hope it helps!\nGrab the template: https://t.co/ru5ufQFpb8", "url": "https://x.com/jeffasu/status/2124981281200988315"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:34:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124979992631071127"], "id": "2124979992631071127", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1626249243160870914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124979962847621277", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TellTalesNot @doganuraldesign Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2124979992631071127"}, {"article": {"title": "A 29-Year-Old Promise Is Becoming Reality "}, "author_id": "1526665365958316032", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:32:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124979403952365989"], "id": "2124979403952365989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 353, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/FLZVyGg6fH", "url": "https://x.com/Porter_and_Co/status/2124979403952365989"}, {"author_id": "1872861011453329410", "created_at": "2026-11-23T21:31:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124979081003573719"], "id": "2124979081003573719", "in_reply_to_user_id": "105287718", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124963530348597735", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@michiesneaks @grok @bot Grok Bot's weekly pool is shared across Grok and Cursor on your seat, so agent runs and code reviews drain it fastest. When it runs dry, I built Reason to keep the work going on your other connected accounts or Reason credits: https://t.co/yhcjO0TQUS", "url": "https://x.com/xadisingh/status/2124979081003573719"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "16_2124992490012884992", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HX19aTWXQAAqyZu.jpg", "type": "animated_gif"}, {"media_key": "13_2124946524350054400", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2124946524350054400/img/WTMp_a2qcrlEU6nB.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2124991081238470656", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2124991081238470656/img/rCiS4_HVLKMB-DkG.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2124985909451837440", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2124985909451837440/img/m7IKdacxNW1j9aVL.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2124985397289607168", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX129c5W4AA3FEv.png"}, {"media_key": "13_2124946367160127488", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2124946367160127488/img/0owkU_VDsvjd8GBx.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "1461076083390906369", "name": "69kov", "username": "levikov"}, {"id": "2085838061347217408", "name": "Grok Bot", "username": "bot"}, {"id": "17